{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_032_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6194f68d30646cacba6c21270275ae5288e8a0c07da0029abed70a1de0f76aeb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b54b5b249bd69a4e21a61973563cde8780b8e1195c3efa9f249396c0fa6dee6",
      "text": "人超级多呢……但是，\n能顺利买到巧克力真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c785fc985e66470148fab5193095e9b9b9138ad2395aae793ab67fbb6c3715e3",
      "text": "直央君送的巧克力，妈妈也\n肯定会很高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e5c69bfe4aaa81708a1c1ea1f8acba982bed9337361193b6a412827148956d3",
      "text": "嗯！●●●●プロデューサー，\n今天谢谢你陪我一起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2e23a0f9f31444583044b47033362c3d63edb1212262d029fb839b95f140ddb",
      "text": "能一起转了那么多巧克力的柜台，\n真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc2540ecf3775735a1b7fa3517ac5a78678f78e4e7a81fa0ec84affe773389c7",
      "text": "还有……这个是，送给制作人的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e6e235e9af2cf000b9aaab3e9795aa3ade9edc4348655c1a345c65523e50baa",
      "text": "直央君，\n也给我买了巧克力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2593235399de620527e8522158be358013cf6da20aa28542a8f825fd98bf9fd0",
      "text": "是的。因为平时一直受到制作人的很多关照，\n所以想表达一下感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac0eee6cb24f075a203a6cd8e228d6d38073ef2e00fc0ac2a7c54fcf6b46a161",
      "text": "再次向你道谢，一直以来非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72506447a9e20448fce5b55e1349c05e72ec2f7b31ea0d7469c6df4fd49b5c13",
      "text": "我也非常感谢你。\n我会珍惜着品尝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_032_23:5_01_032_23_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fb35c3950df507bdcaa1a81f15dd1fb6f1a8daf6353e2b8b4e41e705af2b488",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……今后也请多多关照了，\n制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
